-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this licence does not cover
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright protects this particular expression — this code, these words, this
visual design. It does not protect the underlying physics, nor the general idea
of representing dwell-time statistics as a game. Those are free for anyone to
build on, and an independent implementation of the same concept does not
infringe this licence.

The scientific results the model is built on are published separately:

    C. Zhu, H. Lo, J. Yu, Q. J. Wang, and Y. D. Chong,
    "Resolution and Robustness Bounds for Reconstructive Spectrometers,"
    Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 123802 (2026).
    https://doi.org/10.1103/yffp-wgsh   ·   arXiv:2512.20415
